# Local tooling / scratch — must NEVER ship into the image. Some (e.g. .claude-flow)
# are created with 0700 perms the non-root container user can't read, which crashes
# the app on any request that scans a served directory (EACCES scandir).
.claude-flow
**/.claude-flow
.kiro
agentdb.rvf
agentdb.rvf.lock
*.rvf
*.rvf.lock
